9. Implementation of Browser-Use & Local LLM for Automated TradingView Extraction
Research & Strategic Decisions
Conducted research on Browser-Use (Playwright-based) and confirmed its feasibility for TradingView data extraction.
Evaluated two approaches:
Full GPT-4o API for both login and extraction.
Hybrid Approach (Chosen):
Headful login using TinyLlama-1.1B-Chat for secure, local credential handling.
Headless extraction using GPT-4o API for TradingView chart parsing.
Automated session re-login on expiry.
The hybrid approach was selected for security (local credential handling), cost reduction, and scalability (multi-user future-proofing).

